			"notes": "## Cosmonautics: Warp Drive v1.1.0\n\n### Added\n- CC: Tweaked support. The Warp Drive is now a peripheral (type `warp_drive`), exposing its energy, saved warp points, selection, and warp controls to Lua. Optional — the mod works fine without CC: Tweaked installed. Two example programs (a status/warp script and a touch-controlled Advanced Monitor interface) are included in the GitHub repository under `examples/`.\n\n### Changed\n- Default `warpCostFE` lowered from 8,000,000 to 2,000,000. Note that existing worlds keep the old value — config files are only written once, so edit `config/cosmowarp-common.toml` or delete it to pick up the new default.\n<img width=\"728\" height=\"828\" alt=\"スクリーンショット 2026-08-26 220638\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cbd7207-6b4b-4a98-b704-9f30c35a0c18\" />\n<img width=\"1216\" height=\"262\" alt=\"スクリーンショット 2026-08-26 215737\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e1f6870-7d24-4140-b5e9-921276e09392\" />\n<img width=\"550\" height=\"195\" alt=\"スクリーンショット 2026-08-26 215722\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9953d1fb-a0ab-42ea-a7b2-aee4ecf94f80\" />"
		},
