			"notes": "## Cosmonautics: Warp Drive v1.0.0\n\n### Added\n- Advancement tree (8 total): a root advancement plus Moonstruck, Crystal Clear, Cutting Corners, Copy That, Point of No Return, Engage!, and Beam Me Up (awarded for a cross-dimension warp).\n- `/cosmowarp clearhyperspace` command — manually clears the hyperspace screen effect if it ever gets stuck.\n\n### Fixed\n- Hyperspace effect could get stuck on permanently. If a second Warp Drive on the same physicalized structure finished its warp first and moved the whole structure (this one included) to a new location, the still-charging drive lost track of who to notify when it finished, leaving the screen effect on indefinitely — even after changing dimensions.\n\n### Known Issues\n- Some multiblock machinery (e.g. Create: Diesel Generators engines) can lose redstone signal reception or fail to stay recognized as a single multiblock after a warp. This appears to be an existing limitation in Sable's structure-relocation handling rather than something specific to this mod — similar reports exist upstream for other mods' machinery on physicalized structures (ryanhcode/sable#379, #1037).\n\n### Credit ###\n**New Mod Icon**\nAuthor: Devina_X\nWork: Create Cosmonautics Expansion"
		},
