			"notes": "## Changes to the WarpDrive Model\nI received a model via Discord and made some visual changes.\nText now appears on the drive's display; you can customize this in the config.\n## Addition of a Memory Card\nWith the goal of reaching Crystal in mind, I added an item designed to record coordinates for the round trip to the moon. While you can't warp with it, its other functions remain the same.\nYou can adjust the number of entries saved in the config; by default, it can store up to 5 entries.\n<img width=\"777\" height=\"585\" alt=\"スクリーンショット 2026-08-01 185817\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9e2d6f8-23a3-487b-9c3f-155ddc8c5254\" />"
		},
